WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:07.280
You must have heard many of the teenagers

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:10.960
around you constantly saying things like “Nobody

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:13.980
understands me!”, “I feel soooo lonely!”

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:16.200
and many such things!

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:19.500
Do you recall hearing such comments from elders?

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:23.060
Even if you have, it would have been a rare occurrence!

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:25.640
But then why do we always hear such comments

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:27.440
mostly from teenagers?

00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:30.760
Is there any specific reason for this?

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.320
The basic answer to this question is

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.340
“ADOLESCENCE AND PUBERTY ”!

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:38.060
Now you may wonder why this happens!

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:41.100
Puberty gets with it SEVERAL CHANGES

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:42.700
in the person.

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:45.160
So do you think these changes will only be

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:47.800
the physical changes? Of course not!

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:51.040
The changes are mental, emotional and psychological

00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:52.540
as well.

00:00:52.840 --> 00:00:55.040
Let’s have a quick glance at the various

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:58.480
changes which adolescent individuals go through!

00:00:58.480 --> 00:01:01.700
Shall we begin with the physical changes first?

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:03.980
The most significant change that puberty gets

00:01:03.980 --> 00:01:07.100
with it is the INCREASE IN HEIGHT !

00:01:07.320 --> 00:01:10.660
To be specific, growth of the complete body.

00:01:10.660 --> 00:01:13.340
If you observe keenly then you may realise

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:16.860
that being kids, girls grow in height faster.

00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:20.000
However, on reaching adolescence, the height

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:22.560
of boys increases rapidly.

00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:25.180
Do you know why the growth in height is maximum

00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:26.900
during this age?

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:30.460
The principle reason is BONE ELONGATION.

00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:33.460
This is the time when long bones in our body, that

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:37.320
is bones of arms and legs get elongated.

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:39.560
However, the growth rate as well as the time

00:01:39.565 --> 00:01:42.100
required for growth will be different in the

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:43.480
individuals.

00:01:43.620 --> 00:01:45.720
Along with the hormones that bring about the

00:01:45.720 --> 00:01:48.700
elongation of bones in our body, nutrients

00:01:48.700 --> 00:01:50.780
are equally important too!

00:01:50.780 --> 00:01:52.920
The nutrient supply to the growing bones and

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:55.980
muscles makes sure that all the parts grow

00:01:55.980 --> 00:01:57.880
appropriately!

00:01:58.180 --> 00:02:01.020
Growth of various parts gets us to the next

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:03.200
important change during adolescence.

00:02:03.480 --> 00:02:05.260
And what could that be?

00:02:05.260 --> 00:02:06.100
Yes!

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:08.760
We are talking about CHANGE IN SHAPE!

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:11.300
It is not possible that the body of a person

00:02:11.310 --> 00:02:13.310
will only grow in length.

00:02:13.310 --> 00:02:15.380
Even the width has to increase

00:02:15.380 --> 00:02:17.240
to make the growth proportional.

00:02:17.620 --> 00:02:20.520
So what differences do we find in the adolescents

00:02:20.580 --> 00:02:22.460
as compared to kids?

00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:25.520
In boys we find that compared to the kids,

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:28.320
these grown-ups have broader shoulders.

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:31.800
That is the reason why boys start appearing stouter

00:02:31.800 --> 00:02:34.040
or robust when they grow.

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:36.858
On the other hand girls experience widening

00:02:36.858 --> 00:02:39.690
of the region below their waist. In addition,

00:02:39.690 --> 00:02:41.920
the girls seem to have gained weight and become

00:02:41.920 --> 00:02:44.080
fat compared to their childhood.

00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:47.680
This was the comparison between different age groups.

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:50.860
But within the same age group of adolescence,

00:02:50.860 --> 00:02:53.670
are there any noticeable changes between boys

00:02:53.670 --> 00:02:55.000
and girls?

00:02:55.120 --> 00:02:56.420
Of course yes!

00:02:56.420 --> 00:02:58.280
Relative to girls, boys have

00:02:58.280 --> 00:03:00.240
prominent growth in their muscles.

00:03:00.640 --> 00:03:02.840
This is the reason why teen age boys like

00:03:02.840 --> 00:03:06.040
to flaunt their biceps to indicate their strength!

00:03:06.420 --> 00:03:08.459
There is one more major difference between

00:03:08.459 --> 00:03:11.050
adolescent boys and girls that we are missing

00:03:11.050 --> 00:03:12.050
out!

00:03:12.050 --> 00:03:14.000
Can you guess the difference?

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:15.720
Let me give you a hint.

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:18.420
When you meet a teen age boy after many years,

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:21.620
his voice astonishes you.

00:03:21.620 --> 00:03:25.140
You notice that the voice of boys starts deepening.

00:03:25.480 --> 00:03:27.360
What do we mean by this?

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:30.420
This basically means that the voice of males

00:03:30.420 --> 00:03:33.720
starts getting deeper on the note of octaves.

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:36.680
In the simplest words, the voice turns somewhat

00:03:36.680 --> 00:03:40.150
hoarse and LOW PITCH. On the other hand the

00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:42.640
voice of girls doesn’t deepen as much.

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:46.480
As a result they develop a HIGH PITCH voice.

00:03:46.480 --> 00:03:48.280
But why does this happen?

00:03:48.420 --> 00:03:50.480
What could be the reason for this?

00:03:50.860 --> 00:03:52.820
Well the major reason is

00:03:52.820 --> 00:03:55.620
INCREASE in the size of LARYNX .

00:03:55.900 --> 00:03:57.780
Now what could this be?

00:03:58.120 --> 00:04:00.920
We all are familiar with the term VOICE BOX

00:04:01.120 --> 00:04:04.140
This is scientifically addressed as larynx.

00:04:04.280 --> 00:04:07.680
So are we saying that the voice box enlarges?

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:09.000
Yes it does!

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:11.440
And in whom does this happen?

00:04:11.440 --> 00:04:13.160
It happens in the MALES.

00:04:13.460 --> 00:04:14.660
Yes!

00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:19.040
In boys, the size of voice box increases during puberty.

00:04:19.140 --> 00:04:21.060
And an amazing fact is that

00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:23.900
we can see this enlarged voice box.

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:25.040
That's right!

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:28.740
We find a protrusion in the throat region when boys grow.

00:04:28.940 --> 00:04:32.260
This is commonly referred to as the ADAM’S APPLE

00:04:32.520 --> 00:04:34.599
And it is due to this that the voice

00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:38.140
of boys is deeper than that of the girls.

00:04:38.140 --> 00:04:40.620
So next time you meet your teenaged cousin

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:43.400
or friend after a long time, you will understand

00:04:43.410 --> 00:04:46.960
why and how that person has changed so much!

00:04:46.960 --> 00:04:49.139
Now I want you to tell me…

00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:51.600
Are there any common changes that we find

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:54.870
in both, boys as well as girls?

00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:56.200
Of course there are!

00:04:56.380 --> 00:04:58.578
We have numerous variations that are seen

00:04:58.578 --> 00:05:01.229
in adolescents irrespective of whether they

00:05:01.229 --> 00:05:03.400
are male or female .

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:05.900
But in order to know them you will have to

00:05:05.909 --> 00:05:08.460
watch our next video!

